==Rewards & Perks for All Seasons==
*'''Unlimited Special Challenge Retries''': Enter & re-enter [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenges]] without paying a standard re-entry fee (usually with [[Gems]]).
*'''Golden Name Cosmetic''': The player's name becomes golden and animated.
*'''Battle Pass Rewards''': Get [[Lucky Chests]], [[Chests]], [[Magic Items]], and [[Gems]] from Battle Pass Tiers. In each typical season;
** For players under arena 15:
***Free players get x2 Wild Shards, x100 Gems, x1 Banner (Frame & Decoration), x26 Gold Crates, x27 1-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x18 2-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x1 3-Star Magic Lucky Chest, x1 5-Star Magic Lucky Chest, x4 Card Boost Potions
***Diamond Pass owners get x6 Wild Shards, x225 Gems, x1 Tower Skin, x1 Emote, x4 Overflowing Gold Crates, x2500 Common Wild Cards, x480 Rare Wild Cards, x90 Epic Wild Cards, x7 Legendary Wild Cards, x3 Champion Wild Cards, x5 3-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x1 5-Star Magic Lucky Chest, and everything from the free pass!
**For players above arena 15:
***Free players get x2 Wild Shards, x100 Gems, x1 Banner (Frame & Decoration), x26 Gold Crates, x28 1-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x13 2-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x1 5-Star Magic Lucky Chest, x5 Hero Boxes, and x4 Card Boost Potions.
***Diamond Pass owners get x1 Seasonal Hero,  x225 Gems, x1 Tower Skin, x1 Emote, x4 Overflowing Gold Crates, x2500 Common Wild Cards, x480 Rare Wild Cards,  x90 Epic Wild Cards, x7 Legendary Wild Cards, x3 Champion Wild Cards, x5 3-Star Magic Lucky Chests, x1 5-Star Magic Lucky Chest.
*'''Clan Gift''': When a player purchases Pass Royale, their [[Clans|Clanmates]] each can claim a gift of 1,600 Gold (or less, depending on [[Experience|King Level]]). Players have to be in a Clan before a clanmate purchases the Pass Royale to be eligible for the gift. Each player can claim up to 10 gifts each season.
*'''Exclusive Emote, Tower Skin, and Battle Banner''': Each Season has at least one Tower Skin, Emote, and animated Battle Banner exclusively obtainable for that Season.
*'''Bonus Bank''': After completing all Battle Pass tiers, for every further crowns gained, the players get a 1-Star Lucky Drop. You can get a maximum of 1 per day (however, Bonus Bank Lucky Drops not unlocked yet will stack). The number of crowns required for a single Lucky Drop unlock is 20.
{{RemovedContent}}
*'''Automatic Chest Unlocking''': Queue up another [[Chests|Chest]] to start unlocking automatically when the first Chest finishes unlocking.
*'''Lightning Strikes''': Strikes down unwanted [[Cards]] from chests to other Cards of the same amount and rarity. Note that after the Strikes are unlocked, every single remaining Pass Royale Chest and Crown Chest will have that number of Strikes, instead of having a total of that number of Strikes. Each player has 7 Strikes unlocked in each Season, the first of which is automatically unlocked upon purchasing Pass Royale.

==Pass Royale Chests==
{{RemovedContent}}
*Pass Royale [[Chests]] do not contain any [[Gold]] by themselves.
*For players who have bought the Pass Royale, all these Chests, along with the Crown Chests, have Strikes unlocked through the rewards.
*The Rare and Epic Pass Royale Chests usually only contain [[Cards]] of a single rarity, but can contain one {{Rarity|Legendary}} Card at [[Arenas|Builder's Workshop (Arena 6)]] or above. This is in contrast to the normal Epic Chest, which never contains a {{Rarity|Legendary}} Card.
*At Builder's Workshop (Arena 6) or above, the Legendary Pass Royale Chest replaces the final Crown Chest of each Season, even available to free players (however, free players do not get the Strikes and just get one random {{Rarity|Legendary}} Card). At Spell Valley (Arena 5) or below, the final Crown Chest is replaced by the Epic Pass Royale Chest instead.
*Players have to reach Builder's Workshop (Arena 6) before the beginning of this Season to be eligible for the higher tier Pass Royale Chests, like Legendary Chests. If a player reaches Builder's Workshop during a Season, the rewards remain at the lower tier.

