==History==
2019 
*Pass Royale was introduced with Season 1 on 1/7/2019, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]].
*On 5/7/2019, an [[Version History#Optional Update (5/7/2019)|Optional Update]] fixed some display issues. It also made Crowns from [[Tournament|Private Tournaments]] not contribute towards Pass Royale.
*On 1/8/2019, a [[Version History#Minor Update (1/8/2019)|Minor Update]] fixed an issue where a queued [[Chests|Chest]]'s timer would sometimes reset before the Chest had finished unlocking.
*On 30/9/2019, the [[Version History#End of September 2019 Update (30/9/2019)|End of September 2019 Update]] slightly tweaked Pass Royale's UI. It also fixed a crash that would happen after skipping Pass Royale tiers with [[Gems]] and fixed an issue where the UI did not refresh correctly on the Pass reward track after closing the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]].
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/10/2019)|October 2019 Update]] on 7/10/2019, new perks were added to Pass Royale (Clan Gifts and the Bonus Bank)  and moved the higher reward tier threshold down one [[Arenas|Arena]].
*On 17/10/2019, an [[Version History#Optional Update (17/10/2019)|Optional Update]] fixed some Shocktober Arena visuals.
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/12/2019)|December 2019 Update]] on 2/12/2019, the Card Booster perk was added, which would level up the featured [[Cards|Card]] to the player's [[Experience|King's Level]].
2020  
*In the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2020)|March 2020 Update]] on 2/3/2020, the Birthday Battlefield was originally an "arena on wheels" that moved in-game, but it was made stationary due to player feedback. The moving feature was then added back in [[2v2]] [[:Category:Modes|modes]], although slowed down. This was reused in some anniversary Seasons.
*On 6/4/2020, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/4/2020)|April 2020 Update]], increased the Bonus Bank to 25,000 [[Gold]] (from 10,000 Gold). This change was reverted on 4/5/2020 in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/5/2020)|May 2020 Update]].
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/6/2020)|June 2020 Update]] on 1/6/2020, more than one Card could be boosted during the same season.
*On 10/9/2020, an [[Version History#Optional Update (10/9/2020)|Optional Update]] improved the UI of Pass Royale Queue Chests and Open Now buttons. It also made Lightning Strikes appear correctly on the Pass Royale free Tower Skin Reward Tier, and checkmark would no longer appears under Pass Royale free Tower Skin Reward Tier.
*On 18/11/2020, the [[Version History#Clan Wars Improvement Update (18/11/2020)|Clan Wars Improvement Update]] made it so that Pass Royale color codes will now displayed correctly for spectators in 2v2 [[Basics of Battle|battles]].
2021   
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/3/2021)|March 2021 Update]] in 1/3/2021, during some Seasons, players could vote for a second Card to be boosted each week for that week out of 4 Cards. The main Card is boosted for the entire season.
*On 30/3/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/3/2021)|maintenance break]] fixed a bug where the game could crash if the player opened their Tier 35 Chest from Pass Royale.
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/4/2021)|April 2021 Update]] on 5/4/2021, [[Magic Items]] were made available on both sides of Pass Royale. Magic Items on the free side come alongside Crown Chests, and do not replace them. However, Pass Royale Chests and Lightning Strikes were removed. It also made it so that Pass Royale is now unlocked at Level 4.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer 2021 Update (7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]] decreased the amount of Crowns required in most tiers from 10 to 5, and the Bonus Bank storage size increased from 10,000 [[Gold]] to 25,000 (previously a temporary feature in Season 10). It also removed the Strike icon from Pass Royale.
*On 1/11/2021, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/11/2021)|November 2021 Update]] added the Royal Wild Chest to the free side of Pass Royale. It guarantees a {{Rarity|Champion}} to anyone in Arena 16 or higher.
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/12/2021)|Season 30]] on 6/12/2022, the main boosted Card can be completely replaced by weekly Cards.
2022  
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/2/2022)|February 2022 Update]] on 7/2/2022, new temporary Cards, have been introduced.
*On 12/12/2022, the [[Version History#Clashmas Update (12/12/2022)|Clashmas Update]] made visual changes to the Boosted Cards of the Season.
2023   
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/4/2023)|April 2023 Update]] on 3/4/2023, Pass Royale was changed to two tiers: Gold Pass and Diamond Pass, with the Diamond Pass having an animated [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]]. The tiers of the pass were increased to 121 (from 35) and all tiers required 5 Crowns to complete, However, the Bonus Bank and certain Magic Items were removed from Pass Royale.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]] added [[Card Evolution|Evolution]] Shards were introduced to the Pass Royale.
2024
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]] removed Gold Pass, decreased the amount of Tiers to 60 (from 121), added [[Lucky Chests|Lucky Drops]] to Pass Royale, and made both Free and Diamond Pass have rewards for every tier. The seasonal [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]] bundle was moved to the Free Pass, while the seasonal [[Emotes|Emote]] and [[King's Tower|Tower Skin]] was moved to the Diamond Pass. The amount of crowns per tier and the rewards got heavily changed on both the free and the paid sides.
2025
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/1/2025)|January 2025 Update]] on 6/1/2025, the number of crowns for the bonus bank got changed, but made 1 Lucky Drop available per day. This also changed the rewards in the Diamond Pass: Chest Keys were removed and Boost Potions were decreased to 4 (from 12), but added 9 1-Star Lucky Drops.
*Starting from the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/2/2025)|February 2025 Update]] on 3/2/2025, the 100 Crown bonus when buying Diamond Pass was removed.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] increased the number of Tiers to 90 (from 60), but removed the Chest Queue Feature. It also changed the rewards for both Free and Diamond Pass.
*On 1/12/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] added the Hero Pass Royale for players above [[Arenas|Arena]] 15. This also modified rewards for every existing Pass Royale.

==Trivia==  
*The Pass Royale's cost is close to the Bucket of [[Gems]]' cost (1200 {{Icon|I=Gem}}) equivalent to the player's region.
*While Pass Royale is active, the player will be unable to use their free name change, should they still have it.
*If Pass Royale is bought when some tiers have been progressed, all rewards on prior Pass Royale tiers will also be unlocked.
*Even though the [[Heist|Safe]] is a single [[:Category:Building Cards|building]], destroying the opponent's Safe counts as 3 Crowns for Pass Royale.

